  "equipment_type": "Fuel tank monitoring console via BACnet gateway",
  "applies_to": "Veeder-Root TLS-3XX / TLS4XX / TLS-450PLUS automatic tank gauge consoles connected to the Veeder-Root QuickServer gateway.",
  "summary": "The QuickServer reads a TLS console over its serial V-R interface and serves BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP. The system-wide points are fixed: 29 Binary Inputs for console alarms and warnings (printer, battery, self-test, clock, poll timeout, database and similar) and 3 Analog Inputs that report alarms from unknown device types. Tank, sensor and input points are added per device with numbers that depend on the node ID.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet IP",
    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": null,
  "default_device_instance": 50000,
  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "Only the fixed system (Table B-1) and unknown-type (Table B-2) points are listed here; they need no profile.",
    "Tanks, liquid/vapor/groundwater/Type A/Type B/MAG/smart sensors, inputs and PLLD lines are added as profiles. Their instances are printed as X001, X002 ..., where X is the device's node ID (e.g. node 3, point 2 = 3002), so they are not listed.",
    "The guide gives no access or state text; access is inferred (inputs are read-only).",
    "BI names are alarm/warning conditions; the guide does not print state texts."
  ],
  "source": {
    "title": "QuickServer Industrial Protocol Gateway Startup Guide",
    "doc_number": "577014-367",
    "revision_date": "Revision D",
    "url": "https://globalfuelingsystems.com/content/577014-367.pdf",
    "unofficial": true,
    "host": "Global Fueling Systems (distributor)"
  },
  "integration": {
    "summary": "Set the console's serial port to 9600 baud, odd parity, 7 data bits, 1 stop bit, add a profile per tank or sensor (node IDs sequential from 1, address = the console's tank or sensor number), then read the system and per-device alarm points.",
    "minimum_points": [
      {
        "ref": "BI 18",
        "name": "System Device Poll Timeout",
        "why": "Console lost contact with a polled device"
      },
      {
        "ref": "BI 16",
        "name": "System Self Test Error",
